      "steps": [
        "Mix chicken with all marinade ingredients; refrigerate for at least 3 hours, ideally overnight.",
        "Heat a large skillet; sear marinated chicken in batches until lightly charred and just cooked, then set aside.",
        "Melt butter in a saucepan, toast whole spices, soften onions, add ginger-garlic, tomatoes, chilli, ground spices and cashews; simmer until tomatoes break down.",
        "Cool the sauce briefly, remove whole spices, blend smooth with measured blending water; return to pan with hot water and heat to the correct sauce thickness.",
        "Add chicken, cook until 74°C throughout; stir in fenugreek, sugar and cream on low heat without hard boiling."
      ]
